ng energy infrastructure. Four people were injured as a result of debris of intercepted missiles in Riyadh. DW has the latest.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Cornell suspends frat parties after gang rape case</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:aa3608c57ad494e88a8cf7c5f91eade4c52b38208a1c32242079ff0cbf00bebb</id><updated>2026-10-14T05:05:24Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T22:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/cornell-suspends-frat-parties-after-gang-rape-case/a-79655735--4025361fcd6c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/cornell-suspends-frat-parties-after-gang-rape-case/a-79655735?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Cornell said no parties will be held at frat houses until the end of the academic year. The university is trying to mend its reputation following its handling of a gang rape case in 2024.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>OpenAI says employee caught planting listening device</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a9629b3673c479145e280ed1c3644916eb39ba6ff4034c0c0449b220c1bd4f6d</id><updated>2026-10-14T05:05:27Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T21:24:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/openai-says-employee-caught-planting-listening-device/a-79655491--3ffcbc60cb62.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/openai-says-employee-caught-planting-listening-device/a-79655491?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A Saudi national employed by the artificial intelligence lab has been arrested after a listening device was planted in a company conference room.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Vatican confirms Pope Leo underwent surgery for lung cancer</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f722193e5c2ea02913d74ae68b3809b4da5635d6ddedab8ad441fdeb8de039dc</id><updated>2026-10-14T05:04:20Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T19:50:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" hr